                    <h3>Streamline Your Editing Workflow</h3><p>Whether you are copying text from a PDF, scraping web data, or drafting a new article, raw text often comes with unwanted formatting, excessive whitespace, and irregular line breaks. Our online Text Formatter is designed to instantly clean up messy text, saving you minutes of tedious manual editing.</p><h3>Standardize Spacing and Line Breaks</h3><p>Irregular spacing can make professional documents look sloppy. This tool automatically trims leading and trailing spaces, consolidates multiple consecutive spaces into a single space, and normalizes line breaks. It ensures your paragraphs look cohesive and structured.</p><h3>Convert Smart Quotes and Clean Typography</h3><p>Different word processors use 'smart' curly quotes which can cause syntax issues in code or inconsistent rendering on websites. Our formatter sanitizes typography by converting curly quotes, dashes, and special characters into standard, web-safe equivalents.</p><h3>Perfect for Writers, Coders, and Creators</h3><p>From developers cleaning up markdown files to writers polishing drafts, this text utility is an essential browser companion. It runs entirely client-side, meaning your text is processed instantly without ever being uploaded to a server, keeping your data secure.</p>
